mat_008,Reasoning,Logical Reasoning,Direction,If you face east and turn right, then turn right again, which direction are you facing?,West,North,East,South,D,East→right=South→right=West? No, correct order: East→South→West actually means facing West — wait, check again. Start east → right(south) → right(west). Answer: West,C,After two right turns from East direction becomes West.
mat_009,Reasoning,Logical Reasoning,Blood Relation,If A is father of B and B is father of C, then A is to C?,Brother,Father,Grandfather,Uncle,C,A is father of B who is father of C → A is grandfather of C.
mat_010,Reasoning,Logical Reasoning,Seating Arrangement,Five people sit in a circle. If A is between B and C, and D is opposite A, who sits opposite D?,A,B,C,E,A,A and D are opposites, so opposite D is A.

mat_011,Reasoning,Numerical Reasoning,Arithmetic,If 3x + 7 = 19, find x.,3,4,5,6,C,3x=12 → x=4; check: 3×4+7=19 correct? Wait 12+7=19, yes → x=4,B,x=(19−7)/3=4.
