zoo2_011,Zoology,Physiology,Hormones,Adrenaline secreted during?,Sleep,Fear,Digestion,Rest,B,Adrenaline = fight-or-flight.
zoo2_012,Zoology,Physiology,Thyroid,Deficiency causes?,Goiter,Scurvy,Rickets,Anemia,A,Lack of iodine → goiter.
zoo2_013,Zoology,Reproduction,Female Reproductive,Fertilization in?,Uterus,Oviduct,Vagina,Ovary,B,Occurs in fallopian tube.
