"bio_0137","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Root Structure","The primary function of casparian strip in plant roots is to","Regulate entry of minerals into xylem","Store food material","Increase surface area for absorption","Provide mechanical support","A","Casparian strip regulates water and ion flow into xylem."
"bio_0138","Biology","Animal Kingdom","Onychophora","Which one of the following is a connecting link between annelids and arthropods?","Limulus","Peripatus","Nereis","Palaemon","B","Peripatus shows characters of both annelids and arthropods."
"bio_0139","Biology","Plant Physiology","Plant Hormones","Which of the following is not a function of gibberellins in plants?","Breaking seed dormancy","Promoting stem elongation","Inducing fruit ripening","Stimulating enzyme production during germination","C","Gibberellin promotes growth, not fruit ripening."
"bio_0140","Biology","Zoology - Circulatory System","Fish Circulation","In which group of animals does the heart pump only deoxygenated blood?","Pisces","Amphibia","Reptilia","Mammalia","A","Fish heart pumps only deoxygenated blood to gills."
"bio_0141","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Root Structure","The Casparian strip, found in plant roots, is mainly composed of which substance?","Lignin","Suberin","Pectin","Cellulose","B","Casparian strip is composed of suberin in endodermis."
"bio_0143","Biology","Plant Physiology","Plant Hormones","Which of the following plant hormones is primarily responsible for promoting cell division in plant roots and shoots?","Ethylene","Cytokinin","Abscisic acid","Gibberellin","B","Cytokinin promotes cell division in meristematic regions."
"bio_0145","Biology","Plant Physiology","Plant Hormones","Which of the following plant hormones is primarily responsible for the inhibition of seed germination?","Auxin","Gibberellin","Abscisic acid","Cytokinin","C","Abscisic acid inhibits germination by inducing dormancy."
"bio_0146","Biology","Zoology - Excretion","Insects","The Malpighian tubules in insects are mainly involved in which physiological process?","Digestion","Respiration","Excretion","Circulation","C","Malpighian tubules perform excretory functions in insects."
"bio_0147","Biology","Plant Diversity","Gymnosperms","In which of the following plants is the endosperm formed prior to fertilization?","Pinus","Pisum","Lilium","Oryza","A","Gymnosperms like Pinus form endosperm before fertilization."
"bio_0148","Biology","Animal Kingdom","Annelida","Which animal exhibits metameric segmentation in its adult body plan?","Earthworm","Cockroach","Octopus","Tapeworm","A","Earthworm shows true metameric segmentation."
