"bio_0153","Biology","Plant Diversity","Angiosperms","Which group of plants is characterized by the presence of vessel elements in their xylem?","Bryophytes","Gymnosperms","Angiosperms","Pteridophytes","C","Vessels are present only in angiosperms."
"bio_0154","Biology","Plant Reproduction","Pollen Structure","The exine layer of a pollen grain is primarily composed of which substance?","Cellulose","Lignin","Sporopollenin","Cutin","C","Exine contains sporopollenin, highly resistant to decay."
"bio_0155","Biology","Zoology - Endocrine System","Insect Hormones","The hormone responsible for stimulating molting in insects is","Thyroxine","Adrenaline","Ecdysone","Gibberellin","C","Ecdysone regulates molting in insects."
"bio_0156","Biology","Animal Kingdom","Echinodermata","In which phylum do animals exhibit radial symmetry as adults and possess a water vascular system?","Annelida","Arthropoda","Echinodermata","Mollusca","C","Echinoderms are radially symmetrical with a water vascular system."
