"bio_0159","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Dicot vs Monocot Stem","Which of the following is a feature of dicot stems but not monocot stems?","Scattered vascular bundles","Open vascular bundles","Absence of cambium","Closed vascular bundles","B","Dicot stems have open vascular bundles with cambium."
"bio_0160","Biology","Animal Kingdom","Echinodermata","In which phylum do animals exhibit a water vascular system?","Arthropoda","Annelida","Echinodermata","Mollusca","C","Echinoderms possess a water vascular system."
"bio_0161","Biology","Zoology - Endocrine System","Insect Hormones","The hormone responsible for molting in insects is","Insulin","Thyroxine","Ecdysone","Adrenaline","C","Ecdysone regulates molting and metamorphosis in insects."
"bio_0162","Biology","Plant Physiology","Plant Hormones","Which of the following plant hormones is primarily responsible for promoting seed dormancy?","Gibberellin","Cytokinin","Abscisic acid","Ethylene","C","Abscisic acid induces dormancy in seeds."
"bio_0163","Biology","Animal Kingdom","Echinodermata","In which phylum do animals possess a water vascular system used for locomotion and food capture?","Arthropoda","Echinodermata","Annelida","Mollusca","B","Echinoderms use water vascular system for movement."
"bio_0164","Biology","Zoology - Nervous System","Frog Sound Organs","In frogs, the organ responsible for sound production is the","Larynx","Syrinx","Vocal cords","Vocal sac","A","Larynx produces sound in frogs."
"bio_0165","Biology","Plant Morphology","Root Modification","Which of the following is an example of a root modification for respiration?","Prop roots of banyan","Pneumatophores of mangrove","Tuberous roots of sweet potato","Stilt roots of maize","B","Mangrove roots (pneumatophores) help in respiration."
