"bio_0537","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Leaf Structure","Which of the following is the main photosynthetic tissue in leaves?","Epidermis","Palisade parenchyma","Collenchyma","Sclerenchyma","B","Palisade parenchyma performs photosynthesis."
"bio_0538","Biology","Zoology - Endocrine System","Insects","Which hormone is primarily responsible for stimulating the molting process in insects?","Ecdysone","Insulin","Gibberellin","Oxytocin","A","Ecdysone triggers molting in insects."
"bio_0539","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Root Structure","The casparian strip is found in which part of a plant root?","Cortex","Endodermis","Pericycle","Epidermis","B","Casparian strip is present in endodermal cells of roots."
