"bio_0541","Biology","Cell Biology","Nucleus","Which organelle is responsible for the synthesis of ribosomal RNA in a eukaryotic animal cell?","Nucleolus","Endoplasmic reticulum","Golgi apparatus","Mitochondria","A","Nucleolus synthesizes rRNA."
