"bio_0543","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Dicot Stem Structure","Which one of the following is a characteristic feature of dicotyledonous stem in T.S.?","Scattered vascular bundles","Open vascular bundles arranged in a ring","Absence of cambium","Presence of bulliform cells","B","Dicot stems have open vascular bundles arranged in a ring."
"bio_0545","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Leaf Structure","Which of the following is a characteristic feature of dicot leaves?","Parallel venation","Reticulate venation","Presence of bulliform cells","Closed vascular bundles","B","Dicot leaves show reticulate venation."
