"bio_0547","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Phloem Tissue","In which plant tissue are companion cells found associated with sieve tube elements?","Xylem","Phloem","Collenchyma","Sclerenchyma","B","Companion cells occur beside sieve tubes in phloem."
