"bio_0553","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Dicot Stem Structure","Which one of the following is a feature of dicot stems but not monocot stems?","Scattered vascular bundles","Polyarch xylem","Presence of cambium","Closed vascular bundles","C","Dicot stems have cambium allowing secondary growth."
"bio_0554","Biology","Zoology - Excretion","Aves","The primary nitrogenous waste excreted by birds is","Urea","Ammonia","Uric acid","Creatinine","C","Birds excrete uric acid."
