"bio_0557","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Leaf Structure","Which of the following is the main photosynthetic tissue in the leaves of dicot plants?","Palisade parenchyma","Epidermis","Phloem","Collenchyma","A","Palisade parenchyma performs photosynthesis."
"bio_0559","Biology","Plant Physiology","Nitrogen Fixation","The root nodules in leguminous plants are primarily associated with","Phosphate solubilization","Nitrogen fixation","Water absorption","Potassium uptake","B","Root nodules fix nitrogen via Rhizobium."
"bio_0560","Biology","Plant Physiology","Mineral Nutrition","Which of the following is an essential mineral element required for the biosynthesis of chlorophyll in plants?","Calcium","Magnesium","Potassium","Iron","B","Magnesium forms the core of chlorophyll molecule."
