"bio_0568","Biology","Plant Physiology","Photosynthesis","Which of the following is a photosynthetic pigment found in cyanobacteria but absent in higher plants?","Chlorophyll b","Phycocyanin","Xanthophyll","Carotene","B","Cyanobacteria contain phycocyanin pigment."
