"bio_0578","Biology","Plant Physiology","Plant Hormones","Which hormone is primarily responsible for seed dormancy in plants?","Auxin","Gibberellin","Abscisic acid","Cytokinin","C","Abscisic acid induces seed dormancy."
"bio_0579","Biology","Zoology - Sensory System","Frog Anatomy","In frogs, the structure responsible for sound production is known as:","Glottis","Laryngo-tracheal chamber","Pharynx","Buccal cavity","B","Laryngo-tracheal chamber produces sound in frogs."
