"bio_0595","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Meristematic Tissue","In which plant tissue are the cells living, thin-walled, and capable of cell division throughout life?","Collenchyma","Parenchyma","Sclerenchyma","Meristem","D","Meristematic cells divide actively."
