"bio_0608","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Root Structure","The Casparian strip is chemically composed of which substance in the endodermal cell walls of roots?","Suberin","Chitin","Cellulose","Lignin","A","Casparian strip is made of suberin."
"bio_0609","Biology","Animal Kingdom","Echinodermata","In which phylum does the adult have a water vascular system used for locomotion?","Mollusca","Arthropoda","Echinodermata","Annelida","C","Echinoderms use a water vascular system for movement."
