"bio_0759","Biology","Human Physiology","Excretory System","In mammals, which structure serves as the functional unit of the kidney responsible for urine formation?","Neuron","Nephron","Alveolus","Osteon","B","Nephron is the functional unit of the kidney."
"bio_0760","Biology","Zoology - Endocrine System","Insects","Which hormone stimulates the process of molting in insects?","Ecdysone","Oxytocin","Gibberellin","Vasopressin","A","Ecdysone induces molting in insects."
"bio_0761","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Root Structure","Casparian strips in plant roots are primarily composed of","Cutin","Lignin","Suberin","Pectin","C","Casparian strips contain suberin."
"bio_0762","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Leaf Structure","Which of the following cells in plants is primarily responsible for photosynthesis?","Tracheid","Guard cell","Palisade mesophyll cell","Companion cell","C","Palisade mesophyll cells perform photosynthesis."
"bio_0763","Biology","Plant Morphology","Placentation","Which type of placentation is found in tomato?","Axile","Parietal","Marginal","Free central","A","Tomato shows axile placentation."
