"bio_0778","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Secondary Growth","Which of the following plant tissues is responsible for the increase in girth of dicot stems?","Apical meristem","Intercalary meristem","Lateral meristem","Epidermis","C","Lateral meristem causes secondary growth in stems."
"bio_0779","Biology","Plant Morphology","Stem Modification","Which of the following plants exhibits phylloclade modification for photosynthesis?","Opuntia","Pisum","Solanum","Brassica","A","Opuntia performs photosynthesis through phylloclade."
"bio_0780","Biology","Human Physiology","Digestive System","Which enzyme is secreted by the gastric glands of infants to help in the digestion of milk proteins?","Trypsin","Pepsin","Renin","Lipase","C","Renin digests milk proteins in infants."
"bio_0781","Biology","Plant Physiology","Nitrogen Fixation","Which one of the following structures is responsible for the initiation of root nodules in leguminous plants?","Root hair","Cortex","Epidermis","Pericycle","A","Root hairs are the infection site for Rhizobium."
"bio_0782","Biology","Animal Kingdom","Porifera","In which animal is the canal system a characteristic feature?","Hydra","Earthworm","Leech","Sycon","D","Sycon has a canal system for water flow."
"bio_0783","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Secondary Growth","In which part of a dicot stem is the cambium present, contributing to secondary growth?","Between xylem and phloem","Inside the pith","Epidermis","Cortex","A","Cambium lies between xylem and phloem."
"bio_0784","Biology","Zoology - Classification","Mammals","Which of the following is a characteristic feature of mammals but not of reptiles?","External fertilization","Exoskeleton of keratin","Presence of mammary glands","Poikilothermy","C","Mammals have mammary glands for milk secretion."
"bio_0785","Biology","Plant Anatomy","Dicot Stem","Which one of the following is a distinguishing feature of dicot stem when compared with monocot stem?","Presence of scattered vascular bundles","Vascular bundles arranged in a ring","Absence of cambium","Closed vascular bundles","B","Dicot stems have vascular bundles in a ring."
"bio_0786","Biology","Human Physiology","Circulatory System","Which mammalian blood vessel carries oxygenated blood from the lungs to the heart?","Pulmonary artery","Pulmonary vein","Aorta","Superior vena cava","B","Pulmonary vein carries oxygenated blood to the heart."
"bio_0787","Biology","Zoology - Excretion","Aves","The main nitrogenous waste excreted by birds is:","Ammonia","Urea","Uric acid","Creatinine","C","Birds excrete uric acid to conserve water."
